---
layout: post
title: "2026 List of books I could not finish"
tag: book-review
---

Sometimes I am reading a book and I cannot get past the first few pages. I really tried my hardest, but it was just impossible (for me). For 2026, these books included:

* Pärm by Rawia Arroum. I understand it's a YA novel, but the book did not make any sense. The first part was annoying to read, but was still okay-ish. The second part was unbearable, and I just got tired of it. The themes and style are clearly YA, but it was written for people with a primary school vocabulary.